  "title": "Quintessential Quick Irish Lamb Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and tangy Irish stew featuring lamb, garlic, and vegetables, with an al-dente finish, made with ayurvedic-sattvic-friendly ingredients. This dish is perfect for a monsoon evening.",
