  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pot over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped onions, carrots, and celery, and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the lamb broth, tomato paste, and browned lamb, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, until the lamb is tender.",
    "Add the cubed potatoes and cook until they are al-dente.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley and serve hot."
